<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Respironics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Respironics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown lowered its recommendation on Respironics Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 8-1/2 to 15-1/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
